At base: `src/read-api.mjs` has `scopedQuery` (the shared per-client filter, fails closed
without a clientId). `listJobs` uses it; `searchJobs` ignores clientId entirely;
`exportJobs` uses `||` instead of `&&`. Plain Node 22 ESM, zero deps, so no setup.sh.
